# Credential material. Claude must never read or print these.
# The enforcing rules live beside this file in .claude/settings.json:
#   permissions.deny Read(...)        - blocks the Read tool
#   hooks.PreToolUse Bash             - blocks cat/grep/sed/... in the shell
# This file alone is not a guarantee; the two above are what actually refuse.

config/.env
config/.env.*
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# ...but example/template dotenvs carry no values and stay readable.
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
!**/.env.template

# Keys, certificates and tokens.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
id_rsa
id_ed25519
**/secrets/**
**/.secrets/**
